OL,3,AThree sisters who drowned in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an inquest, senior coroner Penelope
OL,7,FSchofield said the women faced adverse
OL,8,Fsea conditions when they entered the
OL,9,Fwater off Brighton beach and could not
OL,10,Fswim.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
