OL,3,AAsos hackers took more personal details
OL,4,Athan first revealed, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo too are the searches customers have
OL,7,Fmade on the website. Terms like
OL,8,F"reclaimed vintage", "glamorous wide
OL,9,Ffit" and "Asos petite" are visible in
OL,10,Fthe data.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
