OL,3,ATanker hit by multiple projectiles in
OL,4,AGulf off Qatar, maritime agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaritime intelligence firm Vanguard
OL,7,Fidentified the vessel as the Antigua
OL,8,Fand Barbuda-flagged oil and chemical
OL,9,Ftanker Acers, which was reported as
OL,10,Fladen with cargo on Saturday as it
OL,11,Fsailed towards the Strait of Hormuz
OL,12,Fwaterway, which connects the Gulf to
OL,13,Fthe Gulf of Oman.
OL,15,FMerchant vessels have come under
OL,16,Frepeated attack in the region since the
OL,17,FUS and Israel's war with Iran began in
OL,18,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
